flowchart TD
    Req([Client PUT/GET/DELETE]):::client --> Recv["Node receives request (ClientRpc)"]:::acceptor
    Recv --> Alive{"leader.isAlive?"}
    Alive -- no --> Elect["LeaderElection.elect (max-ID wins)"]:::fail
    Elect --> Forward
    Alive -- yes --> Forward["Forward TransactionPacket to leader<br/>(ConsensusRpc.hasTransaction)"]:::leader
    Forward --> Kind{read or write?}
    Kind -- "GET (read)" --> LocalRead["Leader reads its own KeyValueStore"]:::leader
    Kind -- "PUT / DELETE (write)" --> Propose["Phase 1 Prepare: AcceptorRpc.Propose<br/>strict-majority Promise via Transport"]:::leader
    Propose --> Accept["Phase 2 Accept: chooseAcceptedValue,<br/>strict-majority Accepted"]:::leader
    Accept --> Commit["Phase 3 Commit: LearnerRpc.Commit on every replica<br/>PaxosLearner applies StoreOperation, CommitLog.append"]:::leader
    Propose -. majority missed .-> Retry["retry with fresh ballot<br/>(&lt;= PROPOSER_MAX_ATTEMPTS)"]:::fail
    Accept -. majority missed .-> Retry
    Retry --> Propose
    Commit --> Resp
    LocalRead --> Resp([Response to client]):::client
    classDef client fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1976d2,color:#0d47a1
    classDef leader fill:#ffd54f,stroke:#f57c00,color:#bf360c
    classDef acceptor fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#1b5e20
    classDef fail fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,color:#b71c1c